cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Species-OT in your research, please cite this software."
title: "Species-OT"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Tokuta"
    given-names: "Yuya"

license: BSD-3-Clause

repository-code: "https://github.com/yuyatokuta/Species-OT"
url: "https://yuyatokuta.github.io/Species-OT/"

abstract: >-
  A software package for geometric inference of cross-species
  transcriptome correspondence using Gromov-Wasserstein optimal transport.

keywords:
  - cross-species analysis
  - Gromov-Wasserstein optimal transport
  - gene correspondences
  - transcriptome data
  - bulk RNA-seq
  - scRNA-seq
